p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Caring Uncle Minpict.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/21/Caring_Uncle_Minpict..png/revision/latest?cb=20211125225052\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Caring Uncle Minpict.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/21/Caring_Uncle_Minpict..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211125225052\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/21/Caring_Uncle_Minpict..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211125225052 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/21/Caring_Uncle_Minpict..png/revision/latest?cb=20211125225052 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Caring Uncle Minpict.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Caring_Uncle_Minpict..png\" data-image-name=\"Caring Uncle Minpict..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\">Guz Khan</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nothing_matters.\" title=\"Nothing matters.\">Nothing matters.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basic_recipe_28.\" title=\"Basic recipe 28.\">Basic recipe 28.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Caring Uncle Minpict.</b></i> was the tenth and final episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">Series 12</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 25 November 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\">Guz Khan</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Caring_Uncle_Minpict.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Caring Uncle Minpict\" was the message that <a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</a> thought <a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\">Alan Davies</a> was trying to convey, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Using_your_whole_body_to_make_individual_characters,_describe_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Using your whole body to make individual characters, describe the Taskmaster\">Using your whole body to make individual characters, describe the Taskmaster</a> task. The title card displays a candy ring in a ring box, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Propose_to_Alex_in_the_most_irresistible_way\" title=\"Propose to Alex in the most irresistible way\">Propose to Alex in the most irresistible way</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Caring_Uncle_Minpict.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Omsorgsfulde onkle Minpict', which translates as 'Caring Uncle Minpict'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Huolehtiva Minpict-setä', which translates as 'Caring Uncle Minpict'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Saftiga frierier', which translates as 'Juicy proposals'. This title is referencing both the <a href=\"/wiki/Drink_all_this_drink_with_your_mouth_open\" title=\"Drink all this drink with your mouth open\">Drink all this drink with your mouth open</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Propose_to_Alex_in_the_most_irresistible_way\" title=\"Propose to Alex in the most irresistible way\">Propose to Alex in the most irresistible way</a> tasks. The word 'saftiga' ('juicy') is carrying a double meaning here, referring both to the fruit squash ('saft' is a type of berry juice drink), and the proposals to Alex being 'juicy' (as in 'scandalous' or 'appealing').</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Omsorgsfulle Onkel Minpict', which translates as 'Caring Uncle Minpict'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Caring_Uncle_Minpict.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alan Davies</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Desiree Burch</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Guz Khan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Morgana Robinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_magnificent_floppy_thing\" title=\"Most magnificent floppy thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most magnificent floppy thing.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Drink_all_this_drink_with_your_mouth_open\" title=\"Drink all this drink with your mouth open\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Drink all this drink with your mouth open. Your mouth must be visibly open throughout. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Using_your_whole_body_to_make_individual_characters,_describe_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Using your whole body to make individual characters, describe the Taskmaster\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Using your whole body to make individual characters, describe the Taskmaster. Your description must be a minimum of 20 characters long. Most vivid description wins.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Work out what your teammate's tasks are. You must stay in the caravan and must not communicate with your teammates in any way. After 10 minutes, you must write down what you think their tasks were. Best guesser wins.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Lick a chocolate button, stick it on your forehead, then transfer the chocolate button to your mouth without touching it with your hands or leaving the chair.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Propose_to_Alex_in_the_most_irresistible_way\" title=\"Propose to Alex in the most irresistible way\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Propose to Alex in the most irresistible way.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_noise_without_the_Taskmaster_identifying_you\" title=\"Make a noise without the Taskmaster identifying you\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> One at a time, make a noise without the Taskmaster identifying you. The person who makes the most unidentifiable noises wins.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>21\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>22</b>\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Caring_Uncle_Minpict.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/caring-uncle-minpict\"><i>Caring Uncle Minpict.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70913-010\"><i>Caring Uncle Minpict.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920132554\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.169 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 673/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26093/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 192/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usag